<title>JAPAN: SOCCER-RESULTS, STANDINGS IN JAPAN'S J. LEAGUE.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-RESULTS, STANDINGS IN JAPAN'S J. LEAGUE.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-04-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Japan's J. League</p>
<p>soccer matches played on Saturday:</p>
<p> Osaka G     4	  Shimizu    1</p>
<p> Iwata	 1	  Osaka C    2</p>
<p> Kawasaki    2	  Yokohama M 2</p>
<p> Kashiwa     2	  Fukuoka    1</p>
<p> Yokohama F  3	  Kobe	 1</p>
<p> Nagoya	0	  Kashima    2</p>
<p>Standings: (tabulate under games won, lost, goals for, goals</p>
<p>against, points)</p>
<p> Osaka G     3   3   0  12   2    9</p>
<p> Yokohama F  3   3   0   8   2    9</p>
<p> Kashima     2   2   0   7   2    6</p>
<p> Kashiwa     3   2   1   5   4    6</p>
<p> Osaka C     3   2   1   5   5    6</p>
<p> Iwata	 3   2   1   4   3    5</p>
<p> Yokohama M  3   2   1   5   8    4</p>
<p> Kyoto	 2   1   1   4   4    3</p>
<p> Ichihara    2   1   1   4   4    3</p>
<p> Kawasaki    3   1   2   4   4    3</p>
<p> Hiroshima   3   1   2   4   5    3</p>
<p> Urawa	 3   1   2   3   4    3</p>
<p> Hiratsuka   3   1   2   3   6    3</p>
<p> Shimizu     3   1   2   2   5    3</p>
<p> Kobe	  3   1   2   5   9    2</p>
<p> Nagoya	3   0   3   3   7    0</p>
<p> Fukuoka     3   0   3   2   6    0</p>
<p>(Note: Winners in extra time are awarded two points instead of</p>
<p>three and winners in penalty shoot-outs one point)</p>
</text>
